Package: GeoTessera
Title: Access Tessera Geofoundation Model Embeddings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sentinel Team", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "sentinel@example.com")
Description: R interface to Tessera geofoundation model embeddings. Provides
    access to 128-channel dense representation maps at 10m resolution derived
    from Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 satellite imagery. Supports downloading tiles
    for geographic bounding boxes, exporting as GeoTIFF files, and visualization
    of global satellite embedding coverage.
